D000032","fullName":"Rep. Donalds, Byron [R-FL-19]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-04","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"FL"},{"bioguideId":"R000612","fullName":"Rep. Rose, John W. [R-TN-6]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-05","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"TN"},{"bioguideId":"M001240","fullName":"Rep. McDowell, Addison [R-NC-6]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-05","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NC"},{"bioguideId":"A000379","fullName":"Rep. Alford, Mark [R-MO-4]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-05","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"MO"},{"bioguideId":"S001228","fullName":"Rep. Schmidt, Derek [R-KS-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-10","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"KS"},{"bioguideId":"F000471","fullName":"Rep. Fitzgerald, Scott [R-WI-5]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-10","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"WI"},{"bioguideId":"S001229","fullName":"Rep. Shreve, Jefferson [R-IN-6]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-24","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"IN"},{"bioguideId":"M001236","fullName":"Rep. Moore, Tim [R-NC-14]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-02-24","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NC"},{"bioguideId":"L000599","fullName":"Rep. Lawler, Michael [R-NY-17]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-03-31","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"NY"},{"bioguideId":"S000250","fullName":"Rep. Sessions, Pete [R-TX-17]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-04-01","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"TX"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T19:04:53+00:00","id":"hr478-119","introducedDate":"2025-01-16","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-05-06","text":"Placed on the Union Calendar, Calendar No. 64."},"laws":[],"number":"478","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Finance and Financial Sector","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"B001282","district":6,"fullName":"Rep. Barr, Andy [R-KY-6]","party":"R","state":"KY"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-01-16","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Promoting New Bank Formation Act</strong></p><p>This bill eliminates and reduces certain requirements applicable to new depository institutions, certain rural community depository institutions, and federal savings associations.</p><p>Federal banking agencies must issue rules allowing a new depository institution or depository institution holding company three years to meet capital requirements. During this period, a depository institution or its depository institution holding company may request to deviate from an approved business plan, and the appropriate agency has 30 days to approve or deny the request.</p><p>In addition, the community bank leverage ratio—a way of evaluating debt levels—is reduced for new rural community depository institutions. Specifically, new rural community depository institutions must have a ratio of 8%, with a three-year phase-in of the rate. After this period, the ratio rises to its current level of 9%.&nbsp;</p><p>Finally, the bill removes certain restrictions to allow federal savings associations to invest in, sell, or otherwise deal in agricultural loans.</p>","updateDate":"2025-04-02T18:14:36Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"Promoting New Bank Formation Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-07-17T23:34:39Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-07-17T23:34:39Z"}
